// (already waived by nanosoc-multicore-system/lint/hal.tcl): PRMBSE
// Compiler directives (`ifdef/`endif) — used in CMSDK IP, acceptable
// (already waived by nanosoc-multicore-system/lint/hal.tcl): CDWARN
// (already waived by nanosoc-multicore-system/lint/hal.tcl): COMDIR
// Block labels — meaningful code structure over mandatory labelling
// (already waived by nanosoc-multicore-system/lint/hal.tcl): NOBLKN
// Missing begin/end in single-statement if/always — acceptable style
